  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1100414.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Las piscinas municipales de verano, que gestiona OndaEnForma, abren desde este domingo durante todo el d&iacute;a, de 11 a 20.30 horas, hasta final de temporada, despu&eacute;s que el s&aacute;bado permanecieran cerradas por competici&oacute;n de nataci&oacute;n.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/OfertaPiscinasVeranoOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 681px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Se puede comer en la terraza de la cafeter&iacute;a-restaurante con unos precios muy asequibles que incluyen la entrada a la piscina.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100400.jpg\" alt=\"p1100400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100401.jpg\" alt=\"p1100401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100402.jpg\" alt=\"p1100402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100403.jpg\" alt=\"p1100403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100404.jpg\" alt=\"p1100404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100405.jpg\" alt=\"p1100405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piscinesdescobertesestiu15/p1100406.jpg\" alt=\"p1100406\" style=